Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.69,0:02:19.75,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I was right in not avoiding her... wasn't I?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.88,0:02:24.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, maybe it was a mistake.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.10,0:02:30.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Because her body was extremely, and unreasonably, light.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:31.19,0:02:34.53,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's right. For her, Senjougahara,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.53,0:02:38.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,the thing called weight... did not exist.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.76,0:04:24.70,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Even though it's the cultural festival, we are already third years.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.06,0:04:27.03,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,There isn't much we have to do seriously.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.21,0:04:29.43,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Besides, preparing for the exams is also very important.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.36,0:04:33.19,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,For starters, let's list some alternatives.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.19,0:04:36.44,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,We'll get everyone to cast their votes from there.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.42,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.63,0:04:41.24,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's fine. It seems somewhat democratic.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.43,0:04:45.01,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Your tone is harsh as always, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.93,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Should I call you stubborn, or is it...?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.79,0:04:56.43,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hanekawa Tsubasa, the class representative.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.01,0:05:01.63,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She is law-abiding, well-mannered, extremely serious, and highly praised by teachers...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:01.82,0:05:03.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The representative of all representatives.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.24,0:05:11.14,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Just for reference, what did you suggest for the cultural festival last year and the year before?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.35,0:05:13.25,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ghost house and café.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.98,0:05:21.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,And, as the vice-president, I'm discussing the plans for the cultural festival with Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.25,0:05:26.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, we have a student named Senjougahara in our class, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.90,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:28.90,0:05:31.62,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,What about her?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, I'm just concerned about her.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.83,0:05:36.79,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Doesn't she always take leave from school since her body is weak?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.79,0:05:39.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I was wondering if she would even be participating in the cultural festival.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.41,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.38,0:05:45.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Besides, don't you agree that the name {\i1}Senjougahara Hitagi{\i0} is very strange and fascinating?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.84,0:05:48.80,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Senjougahara... that surname comes from the name of a place.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, not that.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.97,0:05:53.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Rather, I meant her other name...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.76,0:05:57.64,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Senjougahara's given name is... Hitagi, correct?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.64,0:05:59.73,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Is there anything as strange as that?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.73,0:06:03.74,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,"Hitagi" sounds like civil engineering jargon.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.74,0:06:05.70,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You sure know everything, don't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.70,0:06:07.70,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,It's not that I know everything.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.70,0:06:09.20,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I just know what I know.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.71,0:06:23.14,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,How rare.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:23.14,0:06:23.68,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.11,0:06:27.36,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun is actually interested in someone else.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:27.62,0:06:29.70,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.94,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Boys always like girls that are physically ill.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:32.94,0:06:34.13,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Ah, seriously...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:34.13,0:06:35.87,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,How disgusting.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.97,0:06:39.04,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Physically ill?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.26,0:06:43.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, but is it really an illness?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.98,0:06:47.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Regardless, what kind of a person is Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.21,0:06:52.87,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You should be more informed regarding things about her, shouldn't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.87,0:06:55.85,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Haven't the two of you been in the same class for three consecutive years?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.17,0:06:59.35,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, we have.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.01,0:07:08.22,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Well, she's an honors student with a clean record.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.26,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Her grades are also pretty good.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:10.26,0:07:11.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:11.45,0:07:15.60,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,But I've only been in the same class as her for a month.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.77,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Indeed, I don't know her that well.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.77,0:07:19.90,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Golden Week lies within that month.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.18,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Golden Week, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:22.18,0:07:25.05,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Eh? What about Golden Week?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.05,0:07:26.11,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.11,0:07:26.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Carry on.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.42,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Oh, let me think...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.42,0:07:32.98,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san... She doesn't speak much.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:32.98,0:07:34.83,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,She doesn't seem to have any friends, either.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.33,0:07:37.81,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,It must be due to her illness.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.81,0:07:42.88,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,She was livelier and more full of spirit during junior high.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.33,0:07:47.96,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Speaking of junior high... Did you go to the same school as her?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.96,0:07:48.78,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.15,0:07:56.77,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,She was really beautiful, good at sports, and the star of the track team.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:58.70,0:08:02.51,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,As such, I heard many rumors...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.51,0:08:03.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What rumors?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.17,0:08:07.71,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,That she's a very good person who treats others kindly.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.07,0:08:11.86,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Apparently her father is an important figure in a foreign-owned business.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.86,0:08:13.78,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,She also seems to be living in a luxurious house.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.78,0:08:16.92,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Despite that, she has never shown arrogance.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.92,0:08:19.00,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She sounds superhuman.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.00,0:08:26.19,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Maybe it's inappropriate to say this, but Senjougahara-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.68,0:08:27.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.88,0:08:33.57,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,...looks more beautiful now than she did in the past.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.58,0:08:40.33,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,A fragile existence.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,"A fragile existence"?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:49.94,0:08:51.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, I just remembered something.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:51.99,0:08:54.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oshino told me to come over.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.12,0:08:55.62,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Oshino-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.62,0:08:56.68,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.68,0:08:58.72,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's just to help with... some stuff at work.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.17,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:00.17,0:09:02.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hanekawa, can I leave the rest to you?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.46,0:09:06.21,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,If you promise to make up for it later, I'll agree to end it here today.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.21,0:09:08.80,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You shouldn't keep Oshino-san waiting for too long.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.33,0:09:09.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.72,0:09:13.49,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Say hi to Oshino-san for me.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.12,0:09:21.38,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What were you discussing with Hanekawa-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.36,0:09:26.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.94,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Ah, I said that wrong.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:31.32,0:09:33.95,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You're free to move, but doing so will be very dangerous.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.95,0:09:35.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's what I meant to say.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:36.12,0:09:39.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Curiosity... such a thing can be compared to cockroaches.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.58,0:09:43.25,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It swarms around the secrets that one doesn't want others to know.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:43.25,0:09:44.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's truly frustrating.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.29,0:09:48.25,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:49.46,0:09:51.26,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Is your right side feeling neglected?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.26,0:09:53.64,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.68,0:09:58.97,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Though I must say, I was careless.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.97,0:10:05.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I really did not expect a banana peel to be at such a place.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.36,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You found out, didn't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.79,0:10:09.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:10.19,0:10:13.61,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't have any weight.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.38,0:10:18.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Despite what I said, I'm not entirely weightless.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:19.32,0:10:25.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,According to my body shape and height, my average weight should be in the range of 45 kg and above.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.30,0:10:27.79,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But my actual weight is...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.77,0:10:30.65,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,...5 kg.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.32,0:10:35.94,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It happened after I graduated from middle school and before I started high school.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.34,0:10:40.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I met a crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It completely stripped me of my weight.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.56,0:10:47.02,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's forgivable even if you don't understand it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.02,0:10:51.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm only telling you this since I find it inconvenient for you to stick your nose into it any further, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:52.72,0:10:53.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.01,0:10:58.16,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi Koyomi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:58.91,0:11:05.66,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Tell me. What should I do if I want to render you unable to reveal my secret?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.04,0:11:09.50,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What should I do for myself...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:10.23,0:11:14.63,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,... in order to make you swear not to reveal it, even if you were to be tortured and interrogated?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.63,0:11:17.03,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What can I do to disable your mouth?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.09,0:11:21.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Regardless, what I want is silence and ignorance.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.45,0:11:25.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If you promise to stay silent and feign ignorance,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.47,0:11:28.27,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,nod your head twice, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.82,0:11:32.40,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Any other action, including staying still, will be taken as an act of hostility.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.05,0:11:34.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,And I shall act immediately.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.90,0:11:37.69,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.03,0:11:38.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.87,0:11:51.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You didn't scream.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.75,0:11:52.77,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.57,0:11:55.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'll let you off just this once.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.30,0:11:57.07,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.55,0:12:01.09,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.09,0:12:03.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,As of tomorrow, you are to ignore me, got it?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.93,0:12:05.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.37,0:12:14.40,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She's exactly like a monster.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:15.02,0:12:15.73,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:20.07,0:12:21.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But it's all right.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This type of injury means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.26,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,My, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.62,0:12:28.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.54,0:12:29.87,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.87,0:12:32.92,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Didn't you need to hurry over to Oshino-san's place?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.92,0:12:35.25,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hanekawa, do you like bananas?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.25,0:12:38.63,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Eh? Well, I guess I don't hate them.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:38.63,0:12:39.82,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Besides, they're nutritious.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.82,0:12:43.09,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,If you insist on asking whether I like them or not, then yes, I like them.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.09,0:12:46.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No matter how much you like them, never eat them in school.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:46.73,0:12:47.53,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:47.81,0:12:49.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's okay to eat just one...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.39,0:12:53.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,...but toss the peel in the hallway, and I definitely won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.81,0:12:56.65,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Just what exactly are you talking about, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.65,0:12:58.53,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,Ah, hey, Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.15,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,You can't run in the hallways!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.30,0:13:05.80,Default,Tsubasa,0,0,0,,I'll report this to the teacher!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.17,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:19.17,0:13:22.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No, I suppose I should say, "I'm surprised," right?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.93,0:13:28.35,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I never thought that you'd be able put up such resistance after suffering from that sort of treatment.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:28.68,0:13:29.68,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.68,0:13:31.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.73,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I understand, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.87,0:13:37.62,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Let's have a war.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.54,0:13:39.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:39.70,0:13:40.96,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't want a war.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.61,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:42.61,0:13:43.55,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's no fun...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:44.86,0:13:46.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What do you want, then?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.78,0:13:51.10,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I just thought... that I could be of help to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.66,0:13:52.68,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Help me?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.16,0:13:57.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Stop joking. What can you possibly do?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:58.00,0:14:01.02,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You only need to shut your mouth obediently and not say anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:01.31,0:14:04.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I consider acts of kindness as hostility, too.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.54,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Your wound...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.34,0:14:20.21,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's gone...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:21.19,0:14:24.36,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You... How can that be...?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:25.57,0:14:28.09,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oshino... Oshino-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:28.41,0:14:30.18,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's right. Oshino Meme.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.95,0:14:34.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Thanks to him, I became a human again instead of a vampire.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.96,0:14:38.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Though, there are still some aftereffects from when I was undead.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:38.54,0:14:40.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hmm... Oshino Meme?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.09,0:14:43.71,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The name sounds very moe.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.88,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You'd be deceiving your feelings if that's what you're anticipating.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.88,0:14:49.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,He's a 30-year-old uncle.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.76,0:14:50.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:50.76,0:14:54.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But he must have been moe when he was young.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:54.56,0:14:57.10,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't use an approach like that to visualize real people.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.52,0:15:00.62,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, do you understand what "moe" and "character" are?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.02,0:15:03.36,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,They're part of general education.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:03.36,0:15:07.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A character like me is known as a tsundere, am I correct?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.03,0:15:11.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It'd be more fitting to refer to you as a tundra.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.67,0:15:24.17,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My butt hurts. It feels numb.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.26,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My skirt is also crumpled.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's not my problem.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:28.01,0:15:30.68,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't push your responsibility. Be careful or I'll chop it off.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What part will you chop off?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.60,0:15:41.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,By the way, where did you put your bag?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.81,0:15:42.90,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You're empty-handed.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.65,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I've stored my textbooks in my school locker.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.65,0:15:50.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Besides, when your body conceals stationery, you don't need a bag.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.11,0:15:51.70,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.70,0:15:56.35,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Without going empty-handed, I cannot fight freely in the event of an emergency.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.79,0:16:00.29,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'll hold that stationery for you.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.08,0:16:02.35,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'll guard it. Hand it over.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.21,0:16:06.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oshino is said to be a weird uncle.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.72,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even so, he's still my savior.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:09.17,0:16:14.16,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I can't let him meet someone dangerous, so let me keep that stationery.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.39,0:16:17.70,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Now you tell me?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:18.60,0:16:20.91,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You set me up, didn't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:26.02,0:16:27.34,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:27.53,0:16:28.84,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Take good care of it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:34.53,0:16:35.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:35.84,0:16:37.62,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't be mistaken.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:37.62,0:16:41.21,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I haven't let my guard down against you.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:41.79,0:16:43.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "you haven't let your guard down"?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:43.92,0:16:45.13,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Keep this in mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:45.13,0:16:48.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My five thousand barbarous comrades
Dialogue: 4,0:16:48.10,0:16:52.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,are stationed to attack your family if they don't receive contact from me every minute.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It'll be all right. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You say a minute is enough to do {\i1}it{\i0}?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:58.01,0:16:59.78,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You think I'm some kind of a boxer?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:01.23,0:17:04.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Both of your sisters are still in middle school, aren't they?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.29,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:19.29,0:17:22.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Don't even think that I'm thanking the likes of you.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.37,0:17:23.71,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:23.71,0:17:25.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Rather, you should be the one who's thankful.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:25.46,0:17:27.00,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I don't understand that.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:27.00,0:17:30.21,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That stapler wound... In order for it not to be obvious...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.21,0:17:34.34,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,...I intentionally stapled it from the inside rather than from the outside.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.34,0:17:37.63,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's the same logic as "to hide the wounds, hit the stomach instead of the face."
Dialogue: 4,0:17:37.63,0:17:39.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's for the good of the attacker, not the victim.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:39.39,0:17:42.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, regardless, it seems that I was worried over nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.23,0:17:44.02,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.64,0:17:48.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If I said, "Being undead is just so convenient," would you be offended?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.10,0:17:49.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Right now... I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.98,0:17:51.53,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm no longer undead.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.70,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's just that my wounds heal faster.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Apart from that, I'm just like an ordinary person.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:58.87,0:18:01.62,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, I'll say this once more.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:01.62,0:18:02.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:02.79,0:18:05.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's difficult to tell from my clothes,
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.87,0:18:10.73,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,but my body might not actually be worth the price you'd pay for committing a crime.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:11.96,0:18:16.05,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How should I say...? On the whole, you seem to be overly self-conscious.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:16.05,0:18:18.32,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,In other words, you have quite a persecution complex.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.59,0:18:19.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.51,0:18:22.66,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Be that as it may, there are things you should and shouldn't say.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.66,0:18:23.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So you knew?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.14,0:18:31.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I must say, I'm impressed that this Oshino person manages to live in such a decrepit building.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:31.32,0:18:34.24,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's a rather weird person.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:34.61,0:18:38.63,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But it's said that he specializes in people like you and me.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.87,0:18:42.20,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Oh, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.20,0:18:43.41,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You're finally here.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:47.29,0:18:48.75,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,What's this, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.90,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You have a different girl with you today?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.13,0:18:52.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.88,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't set me up as some cheap person.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.21,0:18:56.05,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:56.59,0:18:58.43,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, miss.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.43,0:18:59.36,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I'm Oshino.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.64,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, too. I'm Senjougahara Hitagi.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.51,0:19:05.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm classmates with Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.95,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I heard some things about you from him.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.19,0:19:09.94,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:10.35,0:19:12.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oshino, around two years ago, this girl{\fnArial}―{\fn}
Dialogue: 4,0:19:12.61,0:19:14.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Please refrain from referring to me as "this girl."
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.44,0:19:16.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then, how should I address you?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.68,0:19:18.20,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-sama.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.36,0:19:21.18,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-sama~!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't use such a robotic tone.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.99,0:19:25.14,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Say it properly.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:25.37,0:19:27.02,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:27.87,0:19:29.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You trying to gouge my eyes out?!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:30.54,0:19:31.77,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Rude comments are an eyesore.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:31.77,0:19:33.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What type of equal exchange is this?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:33.61,0:19:38.23,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Copper: 40 g. Iron: 25 g. Nickel: 15 g.\NConcealing embarrassment: 5 g.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:38.23,0:19:42.20,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Add 97 kg of bad intentions, and you've got my statement.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That was mostly just bad intentions!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:43.82,0:19:46.03,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Just so you know, that concealing embarrassment part was a lie.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:46.03,0:19:48.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You just deleted the element that you shouldn't delete!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:48.85,0:19:51.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,In any case, before we start...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:51.06,0:19:53.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Who is that kid?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:54.07,0:19:56.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, don't mind that.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:56.65,0:19:57.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,One without shape or shadow...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:57.99,0:20:00.80,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,A child which doesn't have a name and doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.03,0:20:02.62,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,No, no, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:02.62,0:20:04.74,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I gave her a name yesterday.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:04.74,0:20:07.35,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,She worked pretty hard for me during the Golden Week
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.58,0:20:09.58,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Eh? You gave her a name?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.56,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.91,0:20:13.14,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I named her Oshino Shinobu.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:13.71,0:20:15.59,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Heart under blade.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.59,0:20:17.55,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,This name really suits her, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.55,0:20:20.15,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Her surname will be mine.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:22.01,0:20:24.60,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,As I was saying, what exactly is this kid?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:24.60,0:20:27.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening? She's nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:27.22,0:20:29.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The remains of a vampire.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:29.20,0:20:31.10,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The leftovers of a beautiful demon.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.87,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Saying it like that is useless, but it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:34.02,0:20:34.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:34.96,0:20:36.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's nothing major.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:36.44,0:20:37.50,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then I will forget it.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:37.93,0:20:40.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I heard you can help me?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:41.32,0:20:42.36,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Help you?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:42.36,0:20:43.91,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:43.91,0:20:46.66,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,The only one who can save you is yourself, miss.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:47.99,0:20:51.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I've been fed that stage line by five other people.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.58,0:20:53.48,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,All of them were frauds.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.96,0:20:56.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're just like them, Oshino-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:58.63,0:21:01.34,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You sure are feisty, miss.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.34,0:21:03.49,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Did something good happen to you?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:03.80,0:21:04.93,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Well, anyway...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:04.93,0:21:07.97,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,If you don't tell me, there's nothing to be said.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:07.97,0:21:10.12,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I keep secrets well. It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:10.64,0:21:13.85,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, let me give the gist of it.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:13.85,0:21:15.65,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No need for that, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:15.65,0:21:17.02,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:17.02,0:21:18.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:18.73,0:21:20.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm able to do it myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:24.53,0:21:26.01,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Weight Crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:26.53,0:21:28.39,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Weight Crab?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:28.39,0:21:32.39,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a myth from the mountains in the Kyushu region.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.79,0:21:37.03,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,According to different areas, Weight Crab is also known as Mind Crab or Heavy Crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.03,0:21:39.55,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Furthermore, God of Emotions is another way of saying it.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:39.59,0:21:41.55,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It's a pun on kani and kami, which are crab and god.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.92,0:21:44.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But... why Kyushu?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.97,0:21:47.97,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,The place doesn't have much unique significance.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:47.97,0:21:51.35,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,If the right conditions are met, it shall emerge there. That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:52.64,0:21:55.35,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,In this case, it doesn't necessarily have to be a crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:55.35,0:21:57.15,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,There are also myths that they are rabbits.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.15,0:22:01.58,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,And... though I'm not talking about Shinobu-chan, there are also myths that they were beautiful girls.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:02.74,0:22:04.24,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It's like the face of the moon.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:04.49,0:22:07.82,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Well, since you say you met a crab, miss,
Dialogue: 4,0:22:07.82,0:22:09.22,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,this time it must be a crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:09.78,0:22:11.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What exactly is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:11.74,0:22:14.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Its name is of no value to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:15.00,0:22:18.00,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,The name is very important. I also mentioned it earlier.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.00,0:22:20.80,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It could originally be a god, rather than a crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.80,0:22:24.09,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I mean, it diverged from God of Emotions to become Weight Crab.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:24.59,0:22:28.07,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You are one of the fortunate ones amongst the unfortunate.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.39,0:22:29.82,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Why do you say that?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.05,0:22:32.77,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Gods are everywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:32.77,0:22:35.31,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,They are everywhere, but nowhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.31,0:22:40.27,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Before you became like this... it was beside you, yet not beside you.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.48,0:22:43.82,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's an ambiguous question and answer, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.82,0:22:46.57,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,This is a Shinto matter. Oh, maybe it's Shugendou?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:46.57,0:22:48.20,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Don't be mistaken, miss.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.68,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,You didn't become like this as a result of something.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.68,0:22:52.72,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It's only that the perspective changed a bit.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:52.95,0:22:54.33,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Perspective?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.33,0:22:55.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:56.04,0:22:59.31,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I'm saying that your "oh, so pitiful" look makes me unhappy, miss.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:05.67,0:23:08.09,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Eh, still so calm, are you?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:08.09,0:23:10.97,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,I thought you were a spoiled little miss.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:10.97,0:23:13.14,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:13.56,0:23:17.31,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,A majority of the people who encounter Weight Crab are like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:17.69,0:23:19.69,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It's not something you can meet because you want to.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:19.69,0:23:21.36,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Interference with this god is uncommon.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:22.44,0:23:24.17,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Uncommon interference?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:25.53,0:23:27.21,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It merely exists there.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:27.21,0:23:30.28,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,It won't come true if you don't anticipate it.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:30.82,0:23:35.22,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Rather, I don't want to dive too deep into this matter.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:35.37,0:23:37.99,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Regardless if it can be done or not, I understand.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:37.99,0:23:41.14,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,If you wish to regain your weight, I can help you.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.56,Default,Oshino,0,0,0,,Besides, Araragi-kun recommended me to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:45.71,0:23:47.47,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You will help me?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:25.37,0:25:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.19,0:25:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.87,0:25:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,About the worker ants,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:28.37,0:25:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You really said it.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:29.16,0:25:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The majority of them actually don't work!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:31.22,0:25:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The majority, 80%, don't work!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:32.89,0:25:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll be pushing my work off onto others!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:33.93,0:25:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with you?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:34.74,0:25:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The worker ant has a name that just sounds pushy in the first place!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:37.84,0:25:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess you can't exactly call them slacker ants,
Dialogue: 4,0:25:39.53,0:25:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got a riddle for next week's preview.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:40.70,0:25:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Riddle!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:41.38,0:25:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Heat & Beat" refers to me but...
Dialogue: 4,0:25:42.93,0:25:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It refers to you but...
Dialogue: 4,0:25:43.72,0:25:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the name of the "&" symbol?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:45.88,0:25:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is that the riddle itself isn't hard. It comes from its phrasing.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:47.73,0:25:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The correct answer is obviously "ampersand!"
Dialogue: 4,0:25:49.93,0:25:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:51.19,0:25:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 4,0:25:51.81,0:25:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitagi Crab Part 2.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:52.94,0:25:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only watch it if you solve this riddle.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:54.58,0:25:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But then no one will see it.
